[32m+[m[32m## 2. API Authorization & Scope Enforcement Architecture[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Attribute Decoration:** Every operational controller action is decorated with `[RequirePermission("PERMISSION_CODE")]` and inherits from `BaseApiController`.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Dynamic Policy Provider:** `PermissionPolicyProvider` registers dynamic policies prefixed with `Permission:`.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Authorization Handler:** `PermissionAuthorizationHandler` inspects the authenticated user's JWT `permission` claims, supporting `.EDIT` / `.UPDATE` aliases and returning `HTTP 403 Forbidden` if unauthorized.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Company & Branch Scope Validation:**[m
[32m+[m[32m  - `UserAccessService.CanAccessCompanyAsync` validates that the user possesses an active `UserRoleScope` entry for the requested `companyId`.[m
[32m+[m[32m  - `UserAccessService.CanAccessBranchAsync` validates branch-level scope when branch-level restrictions apply.[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Cross-company or cross-branch manipulation by unauthorized users returns `HTTP 401 Unauthorized` or `HTTP 403 Forbidden`.[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Platform users are blocked from tenant operational domain controllers (`return Forbid()`).[m
